# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in the value.
#
# Web3Forms access key — powers the contact form.
# Get one free (no account needed) at https://web3forms.com:
#   1. Enter nirbhay2004g@gmail.com
#   2. Check that inbox for the access key
#   3. Paste it below
